# Measurement artifacts (generated / secret — never commit)
docs/measurement/fig-*.png
docs/measurement/*_meas.csv
docs/measurement/*.pcap
docs/measurement/broker/*.key
docs/measurement/broker/*.crt
docs/measurement/broker/*.csr
